.Dd May 29, 2026
.Dt ZDOTS-OBSERVABILITY 7
.Os zdots
.Sh NAME
.Nm zdots-observability
.Nd tracing and diagnostics model for zdots
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Zdots uses local JSONL traces, optional OpenTelemetry export, deploy log packs,
and service status probes. The OTel Collector forwards logs, metrics, and traces
to OpenObserve, the native local backend
.Pq Xr openobserve-ctl 8 ,
which replaced the containerized LGTM stack
.Pq Z-134 .
Non-OTel diagnostics are intentionally available when the collector or backend
is down.
.Pp
Local telemetry is disposable and self-trims on a retention window
.Pq Ev ZDOTS_O2_RETENTION_DAYS .
Retention is a ceiling, not a brake on ingest volume: when the store grows the
cause is usually a high-volume derived metric (spanmetrics histograms), not
retention
.Pq Z-156 .
The collector tunes the spanmetrics connector at the source, and
.Xr zdots-doctor 1
warns when the store exceeds
.Ev ZDOTS_O2_SIZE_WARN_GB .
.Sh SURFACES
.Bl -tag -width "zdots-log-analyze"
.It Xr zdots-ctl 8
Service and health checks.
.It Xr openobserve-ctl 8
OpenObserve backend lifecycle and retention.
.It Xr capabilities 1
Environment contract.
.It Xr zdots-log-analyze 1
Deploy/update diagnostics independent of OTel.
.It Pa ~/.local/state/zsh/traces.jsonl
Local trace stream.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr openobserve-ctl 8 ,
.Xr zdots-doctor 1 ,
.Xr otel-collector 8
